# First-time Setup planning only. No context job or provider call is launched.
name: Setup preserves a finite context plan and shared allowance
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 READY THE MAP RUN | setup
keys: Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Build threat model | map-selection
ask: Does the Map selection show which preparation tasks are selected and distinguish optional model-backed context work?
keys: Down Down Down Space Enter
require-live-snap: 20 READY THE MAP RUN | setup-with-context
expect: Allowance
expect: APPROVAL NEXT
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | context-from-setup
expect: 3 fixed jobs
expect: set explicitly
ask: Does Setup open the same bounded context flow, with both preparation jobs included and no work already running?
keys: t
type: 5
keys: Enter r
type: 2
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | prepared-map
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/setup_context_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 READY THE MAP RUN | back-to-setup
expect: APPROVAL NEXT
ask: Does Back retain the selected Map work and return to the same Setup row?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | reopened-map
expect: Total calls: 5
expect: Protected review: 2
expect: Review plan and allowance
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/setup_context_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART reopened
resize: 80x24
live-snap: map-plan-80
ask: Is the three-job workload and shared allowance readable at 80x24?
resize: 60x20
live-snap: map-plan-60
ask: Does the 60x20 layout keep the main action, fixed workload and navigation understandable?
resize: 40x12
live-snap: map-plan-40
ask: Does the smallest layout retain the full next action and visible paging and Back controls?
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
keys: PPage
live-snap: map-plan-40-preparation
ask: Can the operator read the ordered preparation tools using the paging controls at the smallest size?
keys: NPage
live-snap: map-plan-40-last
ask: Does the last page preserve investigation identity and explain that new drafts retain past spending?
resize: 96x89
live-snap: map-plan-tall
ask: Does the tall layout clearly separate selected jobs, allowance, model and source identity?
keys: Tab
live-snap: map-options
expect: context:build
expect: entry-points:extract
ask: Does the options view show the frozen inputs for every selected task, including preparation?
keys: Tab
resize: 160x48
live-snap: map-plan-wide
ask: Does the wide layout maintain a comfortable reading width and visible controls?
resize: 40x12
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | map-approval
keys: y
require-live-snap: 15 Read remaining terms | map-approval-gated
resize: 80x36
live-snap: map-approval-complete
expect: 3 fixed jobs
expect: attempt(s) each
ask: Does the complete approval disclose all three jobs, their attempt limit, retained spending and uncertain dollar costs?
resize: 40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | map-approval-last
ask: Does the final approval state that cancellation consumes attempts and approval starts no work?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Open approved Map jobs | approved-map
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/setup_context_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
keys: Enter
resize: 120x36
require-live-snap: 20 L starts the approved jobs | map-jobs
expect: context:build
expect: entry-points:extract
expect: threat-model:build
ask: Are all selected jobs visible and planned, with a distinct explicit launch action?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 15 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | quit-review
ask: Does exit distinguish unsaved Setup selections from the already persisted plan and avoid implying active work?
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 GENERATE STUDY CONTEXT | recovered-map
expect: Open approved Map jobs
expect: 3 fixed jobs
expect: Total calls: 5
expect: Protected review: 2
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/setup_context_study.py @TMP_TARGET @ART resumed
ask: Does restart preserve the exact plan and shared allowance in plain color mode, with no implicit launch or new allowance?
keys: Escape Escape Escape C-c
